<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BPI jumps 6.1 pct to record.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BPI jumps 6.1 pct to record.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Banco Portugues de Investimento soared 6.1 percent to a record 4,000 escudos in early trade on Monday as all Portuguese banks began strongly, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the buying was coming mainly from domestic investors and that it followed the release of an update to a positive review of the banking sector by investment house Salomon Brothers.</p>
</text>
